<title>USA: MBIA lists secondary market insurance capacity.</title>
<headline>MBIA lists secondary market insurance capacity.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Friday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for the following issuers:</p>
<p>--Local Government Assistance Corp., N.Y.</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico highway bonds.</p>
<p>--New York City general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--Denver International Airport.</p>
<p>--New York City municipal water bonds.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-MBIA-NOW.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
